Text_ExplosionTeach::
	.string "你能想象吗？\n如果这座火山喷发？\p随之而来的爆炸会要了\n我们的命。那该有多恐怖？\p趁我们还在害怕的时候\n你想让我教你大爆炸吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

Text_ExplosionDeclined::
	.string "嗯，没错。\n这太可怕了。$"
	.string ""

Text_ExplosionWhichMon::
	.string "你真是勇敢！\p哪只宝可梦想要学会\n大爆炸？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

Text_ExplosionTaught::
	.string "在这座火山上使用大爆炸……\p这真是让我毛骨悚然地兴奋！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_WellTryDiggingHere::
	.string "在这里。\n我们会试着在这里挖掘。\p干部们谈论的宝藏应该就在这里。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_YoureInTheWayGetLost::
	.string "搞什么呢……\n你挡道了。给我滚开。$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_PunchedThroughAtLast::
	.string "呼，总算打穿了。\n让我们去挖掘宝藏吧！$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_WhatsPasswordAgain::
	.string "我们发现的任何宝藏，\n都要拖回仓库的，明白吗？\p……哦，顺便密码是什么？\n我是说火箭队仓库的密码。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_FirstPasswordGoldeen::
	.string "什么，你把密码忘了？\n实际上密码有两个。\p第一个是“多多少少\n少少多多。”\p第二个是……$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_SnoopsBeenListeningIn::
	.string "嘿！\n这家伙一直在偷听！$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_Grunt1Intro::
	.string "你一直在偷听我们说话，\n对吗？$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
	.string "呃，什么？$"

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
	.string "为什么你一定要赢？$"

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_Grunt2Intro::
	.string "想要着偷走我们的宝藏？\n趁早放弃吧！$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
	.string "等等！\n可是现在该怎么办？$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
	.string "健忘症能很方便地\n使你忘记你所听到的一切！$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_WellRegroupDontStepInsideThere::
	.string "好一次挫折啊……\n我们要重新组队。\p你！不要妄想从这儿往里走一步！\p如果你想知道做什么最好，\n那就放弃往里走的念头吧！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_LoganIntro::
	.string "活火山是指正在喷发的，\n或将要喷发的火山。$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_LoganDefeat::
	.string "呜……太热了！\n汗山爆发啊！$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_LoganPostBattle::
	.string "有人说世界上有超过1500个活火山。\p只是想想就让我感到全身发热！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_BethIntro::
	.string "你知道火山中的洞穴是如何形成的吗？$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_BethDefeat::
	.string "啊！\n你真是令人震惊的强大！$"
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_BethPostBattle::
	.string "当岩浆表面的熔岩变硬，\n其内部的岩浆流了出来，\l洞穴就形成了。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_JocelynIntro::
	.string "我不断地锻炼来修补\n我破碎的心……\p那至少让我在身体上更坚韧！\n嗬呀！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_JocelynDefeat::
	.string "我觉得我做太过了……$"

MtEmber_Exterior_Text_JocelynPostBattle::
	.string "你战斗的方式，\n使我想起了甩了我的家伙……$"
	.string ""

